pub const PROJECT_INFO_SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION: &str = "## **1. Project Information**\n\n**1.1 Project Title**\n\n- Clearly state the project title.\n\n**1.2 Project Scope**\n\n- Provide a concise description of the project's scope and objectives. Include:\n  - Defined objectives and key goals\n  - Project boundaries (inclusions and exclusions)\n  - Stakeholder identification (primary and secondary)\n  - Developed timeline with start/end dates and milestones\n  - Resource allocation and team responsibilities\n  - Risk assessment and mitigation strategies\n  - Approval process and sign-off details\n\n**1.3 Field of Study**\n\n- Indicate the academic field relevant to the project. Justify your selection by:\n  - Researching common fields related to your topic\n  - Consulting experts or advisors\n\n**1.4 Target Audience**\n\n- Identify the intended audience by:\n  - Conducting market research, including industry trends and competitor analysis\n  - Defining demographics (age, gender, location, etc.)\n  - Identifying psychographics (interests, values, lifestyle)\n  - Gathering audience feedback through surveys and focus groups\n  - Analyzing existing customer data\n  - Creating and validating audience personas\n";
